n":"An underwater sediment accumulation."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/boca-de-albufera-grao","prefLabel":{"es":"boca de albufera; grao","en":"lagoon inlet"},"definition":{"es":"Abertura de comunicación entre una albufera y el mar.","en":"Opening connecting a coastal lagoon with the sea."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/borde-de-terraza-con-indicacion-de-cota-en-metros","prefLabel":{"es":"borde de terraza con indicación de cota en metros","en":"terrace edge with elevation in metres"},"definition":{"es":"Borde de una terraza litoral con indicación de su cota sobre el nivel del mar.","en":"Edge of a coastal terrace with indication of its elevation above sea level."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/brazo-fluvial","prefLabel":{"es":"brazo fluvial","en":"distributary channel"},"definition":{"es":"Canal de distribución en un delta.","en":"A distribution channel in a delta."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/brazo-fluvial-abandonado","prefLabel":{"es":"brazo fluvial abandonado","en":"abandoned distributary channel"},"definition":{"es":"Canal de distribución deltaico ya no funcional.","en":"A deltaic distribution channel no longer functional."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/brazo-fluvial-abandonado-inundado-temporalmente","prefLabel":{"es":"brazo fluvial abandonado inundado temporalmente","en":"temporarily flooded abandoned distributary"},"definition":{"es":"Canal deltaico abandonado que se inunda temporalmente.","en":"An abandoned deltaic channel that is temporarily flooded."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/brazo-fluvial-con-flujo-de-marea","prefLabel":{"es":"brazo fluvial con flujo de marea","en":"tidal distributary channel"},"definition":{"es":"Canal de distribución deltaico afectado por mareas.","en":"A deltaic distribution channel affected by tides."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/canal-de-marea","prefLabel":{"es":"canal de marea","en":"tidal channel"},"definition":{"es":"Canal excavado por las corrientes de marea.","en":"A channel carved by tidal currents."},"narrower":[{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/canal-de-marea-abandonado","prefLabel":{"es":"canal de marea abandonado","en":"abandoned tidal channel"},"definition":{"es":"Canal de marea que ya no es funcional.","en":"A tidal channel that is no longer functional."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/canal-de-marea-sumergido","prefLabel":{"es":"canal de marea sumergido","en":"submerged tidal channel"},"definition":{"es":"Canal de marea permanentemente bajo el agua.","en":"A tidal channel permanently underwater."}}]},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/construcciones-biogenicas","prefLabel":{"es":"construcciones biogénicas","en":"biogenic constructions"},"definition":{"es":"Estructuras construidas por organismos marinos como arrecifes de coral.","en":"Structures built by marine organisms such as coral reefs."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/cordon-litoral","prefLabel":{"es":"cordón litoral","en":"beach ridge; barrier"},"definition":{"es":"Cresta alargada de sedimentos paralela a la costa.","en":"An elongated sediment ridge parallel to the coast."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/delta","prefLabel":{"es":"delta","en":"delta"},"definition":{"es":"Depósito sedimentario en la desembocadura de un río.","en":"A sedimentary deposit at the mouth of a river."},"narrower":[{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/delta-sumergido-de-flujo","prefLabel":{"es":"delta sumergido; de flujo","en":"submerged delta; flow delta"},"definition":{"es":"Parte del delta situada bajo el nivel del agua.","en":"Part of the delta located below water level."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/frente-deltaico","prefLabel":{"es":"frente deltaico","en":"delta front"},"definition":{"es":"Zona frontal de un delta en contacto con el mar.","en":"The frontal zone of a delta in contact with the sea."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/llanura-deltaica","prefLabel":{"es":"llanura deltaica","en":"delta plain"},"definition":{"es":"Superficie plana de un delta emergido.","en":"The flat surface of an emerged delta."}}]},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/deriva-litoral","prefLabel":{"es":"deriva litoral","en":"longshore drift"},"definition":{"es":"Transporte de sedimentos a lo largo de la costa por corrientes litorales.","en":"Sediment transport along the coast by longshore currents."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/derrame-delta-de-ruptura-de-mota","prefLabel":{"es":"derrame; delta de ruptura de mota","en":"crevasse splay"},"definition":{"es":"Depósito formado por la rotura del dique natural en un delta.","en":"Deposit formed by the breach of a natural levee in a delta."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/direccion-del-viento-dominante","prefLabel":{"es":"dirección del viento dominante","en":"prevailing wind direction"},"definition":{"es":"Dirección predominante del viento en la zona litoral.","en":"Predominant wind direction in the coastal area."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/estuario-marisma","prefLabel":{"es":"estuario; marisma","en":"estuary; salt marsh"},"definition":{"es":"Desembocadura de un río donde se mezclan aguas dulces y saladas.","en":"River mouth where fresh and salt water mix."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/flecha-litoral","prefLabel":{"es":"flecha litoral","en":"spit"},"definition":{"es":"Lengua de arena que se extiende desde la costa hacia el mar.","en":"A tongue of sand extending from the coast towards the sea."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/llanura-de-marea","prefLabel":{"es":"llanura de marea","en":"tidal flat"},"definition":{"es":"Superficie plana inundada periódicamente por las mareas.","en":"A flat surface periodically flooded by tides."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/llanura-de-marea-arenosa","prefLabel":{"es":"llanura de marea arenosa","en":"sandy tidal flat"},"definition":{"es":"Llanura de marea con substrato arenoso.","en":"A tidal flat with a sandy substrate."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/marisma-alta-schorre","prefLabel":{"es":"marisma alta; schorre","en":"high marsh; schorre"},"definition":{"es":"Zona de marisma solo inundada en mareas vivas.","en":"Marsh zone only flooded during spring tides."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/marisma-baja-slikke","prefLabel":{"es":"marisma baja; slikke","en":"low marsh; slikke"},"definition":{"es":"Zona de marisma inundada en cada marea.","en":"Marsh zone flooded at each tide."},"narrower":[{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/marisma-baja-arenosa","prefLabel":{"es":"marisma baja arenosa","en":"sandy low marsh"},"definition":{"es":"Marisma baja con substrato arenoso.","en":"Low marsh with a sandy substrate."}}]},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/plataforma-de-abrasion-rasa","prefLabel":{"es":"plataforma de abrasión; rasa","en":"wave-cut platform; strandflat"},"definition":{"es":"Superficie rocosa plana tallada por la erosión marina.","en":"A flat rock surface carved by marine erosion."},"narrower":[{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natur